<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK Q1 CONS NET 136.1 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK Q1 CONS NET 136.1 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Estonian bank Hansapank</p>
<p>on Monday said that its consolidated net income in the first</p>
<p>quarter of 1997 was 136.1 million kroons versus 52.5 million</p>
<p>kroons in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank released the following income and balance</p>
<p>statement:</p>
<p> INCOME				 (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net interest income		     126.7 vs  65.5</p>
<p> Interest income			   179.2 vs  92.1</p>
<p> Commission				   68.6 vs  30.5</p>
<p> Trading income			    105.2 vs  35.0</p>
<p> Total revenue			     297.3 vs 134.7</p>
<p> Service fees paid			  14.8 vs   9.8</p>
<p> Personnel costs			    43.3 vs  25.5</p>
<p> Administrative costs		     30.3 vs  18.5</p>
<p> Total non-interest expenses	   104.4 vs  62.3</p>
</text>
